{'symbol': 'IDXX', 'date': '2022-04-11 15:00:00', 'title': 'IDEXX LABORATORIES TO RELEASE 2022 FIRST QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'WESTBROOK, MAINE , APRIL 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IDEXX LABORATORIES, INC. (NASDAQ: IDXX), A GLOBAL LEADER IN VETERINARY DIAGNOSTICS, VETERINARY PRACTICE SOFTWARE AND WATER MICROBIOLOGY TESTING, HAS SCHEDULED THE RELEASE OF ITS 2022 FIRST QUARTER RESULTS FOR WEDNESDAY, MAY 4, 2022 BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS. THE COMPANY WILL CONDUCT AN ANALYST CONFERENCE CALL BEGINNING AT 8:30 A.M.'}